    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Ledgerly — bookkeeping that closes itself</title>\n<style>\n  body { margin: 0; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; color: #1c1f26; background: #fbfbfc; }\n  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e8ee; }\n  .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .nav ul { display: flex; gap: 22px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5060; }\n  .nav .cta { padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: #2f6bff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; }\n  .hero { padding: 88px 40px 64px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .hero h1 { font-size: 48px; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px; }\n  .hero p { font-size: 18px; color: #4b5060; margin: 0 auto 28px; max-width: 540px; }\n  .hero .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }\n  .btn { padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; }\n  .btn.primary { background: #2f6bff; color: #fff; }\n  .btn.ghost { border: 1px solid #d5d8e0; color: #1c1f26; }\n  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding: 24px 40px 72px; max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .card { padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #e6e8ee; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; }\n  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 16px; }\n  .card p { margin: 0; color: #4b5060; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .pricing { background: #111318; color: #fff; padding: 64px 40px; text-align: center; }\n  .pricing h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .pricing .price { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; margin: 18px 0 6px; }\n  .pricing small { color: #9aa0b0; }\n  footer { padding: 28px 40px; font-size: 13px; color: #8a8f9d; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }\n  @media (max-width: 720px) { .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; } .nav ul { display: none; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <nav class=\"nav\">\n    <span class=\"brand\">Ledgerly</span>\n    <ul><li>Product</li><li>Pricing</li><li>Docs</li><li>Changelog</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Start free</a>\n  </nav>\n  <section class=\"hero\" id=\"hero\">\n    <h1>Bookkeeping that closes itself</h1>\n    <p>Ledgerly reads your bank feed, matches every transaction and drafts the month-end close, so you review instead of retype.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#\">Start free trial</a>\n      <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#\">See a sample close</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"features\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Auto-matching</h3><p>Receipts, invoices and bank lines paired with 98% precision, the rest queued for a one-click decision.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Draft close</h3><p>Accruals, deferrals and reconciliations proposed on the 1st; you approve the ones that matter.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Audit trail</h3><p>Every automated entry carries its evidence and the rule that made it, ready for your accountant.</p></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"pricing\" id=\"pricing\">\n    <h2>One plan, no seats</h2>\n    <div class=\"price\">$49<small>/month</small></div>\n    <small>Unlimited transactions. Cancel any time.</small>\n  </section>\n  <footer><span>© Ledgerly</span><span>Privacy · Terms</span></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
